  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哪有可能辦得到！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54EA670953EF80FD8FA65F975230FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "老爺我可是客人啊！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8001723A621153EF662F5BA24EBA554AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>！\n我知道這很任性，但<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳救救我吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF010010000201000000FF01000A621177E5905390195F884EFB6027FF0C4F4600100003110000FF01014F6059B36551655162115427FF01001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我剛才要幫這個人搬行李，\n結果他不只是無理刁難，而且啊，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n還要我跟他打寶可夢對戰。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211525B624D89815E6B9019500B4EBA642C884C674EFF0C000A7D50679C4ED64E0D53EA662F71217406520196E3FF0C800C4E14554AFF0C00100001BE00000A9084898162118DDF4ED662535BF653EF59225C0D62303002001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我拜託妳搬運我心愛的波士可多拉，\n是妳拒絕說做不到，我才這麼生氣！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621162DC8A1759B3642C904B62115FC3611B76846CE258EB53EF591A62C9FF0C000A662F59B362D27D558AAA505A4E0D5230FF0C6211624D90199EBC751F6C23FF01001000020114018E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "波士可多拉的體重是360公斤，\n怎麼可能搬得動！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CE258EB53EF591A62C976849AD491CD662F003300360030516C65A4FF0C000A600E9EBC53EF80FD642C5F9752D5FF01001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "囉唆！明明搬不動還想搬，\n看我怎麼打直妳那歪脾氣！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n要不，<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳們兩個一起上也行！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56C95506FF01660E660E642C4E0D52D5908460F3642CFF0C000A770B6211600E9EBC625376F459B390A36B6A813E6C23FF0100100001BE00000A89814E0DFF0C00100003110000FF01014F6059B350115169500B4E008D774E0A4E5F884CFF01001000020114018E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "老爺我來到密阿雷市，\n就是為了要挑戰ZA登峰戰！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n要是連<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳們倆這樣嬌弱弱的訓練家\n都無法一次解決，我哪來的資格參賽。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8001723A62114F8652305BC6963F96F75E02FF0C000A5C31662F70BA4E86898163116230005A0041767B5CF06230FF0100100001BE01000A8981662F902300100003110000FF01014F6059B35011500690196A235B0C5F315F3176848A137DF45BB6000A90FD71216CD54E006B2189E36C7AFF0C621154EA4F8676848CC7683C53C38CFD3002001000020114018E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳看他根本不可理喻。\n所以<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳就陪我一起對戰吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B3770B4ED66839672C4E0D53EF740655BB3002000A62404EE500100003110000FF01014F6059B35C31966A62114E008D775C0D62305427FF01001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳願意陪我一起對戰嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B39858610F966A62114E008D775C0D623055CEFF1F001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好啊",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D554A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "稍等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7A0D7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳要讓我等到什麼時候？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "2026202600100003110000FF01014F6059B389818B9362117B4952304EC09EBC66425019FF1F001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "想想我和<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的相遇，\n是頑皮熊貓帶來的呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60F360F36211548C00100003110000FF01014F6059B3768476F89047FF0C000A662F981176AE718A8C935E364F86768454623002001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那時真是抱歉了，\n但這次可要請多指教了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A36642771F662F62B16B494E86FF0C000A4F4690196B2153EF89818ACB591A630765594E86FF01001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看老爺我用我的波士可多拉牠們\n把<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳們倆打飛打爆！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B8001723A62117528621176846CE258EB53EF591A62C972605011000A628A00100003110000FF01014F6059B350115006625398DB62537206FF01001000020114018E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "想不到密阿雷市的訓練家\n水準竟然會這麼高……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60F34E0D52305BC6963F96F75E0276848A137DF45BB6000A6C346E967ADF7136670390199EBC9AD820262026001000020114018E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我不參加ZA登峰戰啦！\n觀個光之後就打道回府吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E0D53C352A0005A0041767B5CF062305566FF01000A89C0500B51494E4B5F8C5C316253905356DE5E9C5427FF01001000020114018E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要不是他無理取鬧要我搬波士可多拉，\n我就會帶他四處觀光了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89814E0D662F4ED67121740653D69B2789816211642C6CE258EB53EF591A62C9FF0C000A62115C3167035E364ED656DB865589C051494E863002001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯恰。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EF607030020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "多虧有<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳，我脫困了。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我明明之前拿了<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的旅行包，\n謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳還是幫了我。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 13,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "591A86676709001000020100000000100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF0C6211812B56F04E86300200100001BE01000A6211660E660E4E4B524D62FF4E8600100003110000FF01014F6059B3768465C5884C5305FF0C000A8B1D8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B39084662F5E6B4E8662113002001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "當時看到頑皮熊貓搬運旅行包，\n讓我靈機一動。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75766642770B5230981176AE718A8C93642C904B65C5884C5305FF0C000A8B93621197486A5F4E0052D53002001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "開始了一邊幫觀光客搬行李，\n一邊由我帶他們四處觀光的生意。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "958B59CB4E864E00908A5E6B89C051495BA2642C884C674EFF0C000A4E00908A753162115E364ED6501156DB865589C051497684751F610F3002001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "畢竟如果是寶可夢的話，\n還能經過圍牆上等沒有人的地方嘛。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75627ADF5982679C662F5BF653EF592276848A71FF0C000A908480FD7D93904E570D72464E0A7B496C9267094EBA7684573065B9561B3002001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我們約定的時間已經過了，\n妳沒事吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ-",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621150117D045B9A7684664295935DF27D93904E4E86FF0C000A59B36C924E8B5427FF1F001000020114002D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "安德烈？\n嗯，我沒事。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B895FB770C8FF1F000A55EFFF0C62116C924E8B3002001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "剛才發生了一點小問題，\n但都順利解決了。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n嗯，我去跟你會合！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "525B624D767C751F4E864E009EDE5C0F554F984CFF0C000A4F4690FD9806522989E36C7A4E86300200100001BE00000A55EFFF0C621153BB8DDF4F6067035408FF01001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "聽說<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳在ZA登峰戰大展身手？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n而我竟然是<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳在密阿雷的第一場\n寶可夢對戰的對手，真是有得炫耀了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "807D8AAA00100003110000FF01014F6059B35728005A0041767B5CF0623059275C558EAB624BFF1F00100001BE01000A800C62117ADF7136662F00100003110000FF01014F6059B357285BC6963F96F776847B2C4E005834000A5BF653EF59225C0D623076845C0D624BFF0C771F662F67095F9770AB80004E863002001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼，哪天再相會時\n也請多指教囉！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39EBCFF0C54EA5929518D76F867036642000A4E5F8ACB591A6307655956C9FF01001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    }
